# The five MacUpdate screenshot PNGs are throwaway conversions of the lossless WebP masters in
# `brand/screenshots/`, made only because MacUpdate's uploader wants PNG. Regenerate them with
# the commands in `brand/listings/macupdate.md` § 3. Media; never commit them.
#
# This file is tracked so the directory exists in a fresh clone and the commands' output path resolves.
*.png
!.gitignore
